        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "Afternoon tea time! There are very few guests at this time, no need to wait for the seats. The restaurant environment is comfortable and quiet. There are more than a dozen choices for afternoon tea set, such as potato, sandwich, salad, spaghetti, cheesecake, etc...but there is no my favorite pancake honey chicken wing with salad sandwich set, so this time ordered the club sandwich, chicken Caesar salad, the salad is fresh and crisp, chicken meat is full, taste fresh and delicious, enjoy leisurely afternoon tea time and have a good time for chatting!\n又係下午茶時間，這個時段客人非常少，完全不用等位，餐廳環境舒適寧靜，下午茶套餐有十幾廿款選擇，焗薯、三文治、沙律、意粉、芝士蛋糕等等……但就沒有從前最愛的熱香餅蜜糖雞翼沙律三文治套餐，於是今次點了公司三文治，雞肉凱撒沙律，沙律菜新鮮爽脆，雞肉份量十足，味道清新味美，休閒享受下午茶，歇腳聊天好地方！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
